---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import SectionDivider from "../../components/SectionDivider.astro";

import "../../../base.css";
---

<PageLayout title={"Donate"}>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl p-6 surface-card textured-panel tonal-block">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-display font-semibold text-ink md:text-4xl">
      Donate to Us
    </h2>
    <p class="callout drop-cap mb-6 text-ink/85">
      The Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling Monastery is a very small, modest
      monastery of more than
      <span class="pill">one hundred monks</span>. The majority of the monks come
      from Tibet, India, and Mongolia. A great many of the monks are from very
      poor families and, as such, are unable to pay for their food, shelter, or
      study, contributing instead by sharing in the daily running of the
      monastery.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
      The upkeep and maintenance of elderly and dilapidated buildings, the
      provision of an adequate diet for the monks, and the cost of good medical
      care place a daily burden upon the monastery. Dedicated as it is to
      meditation, study, and spiritual training, the monastery must rely upon
      the support of kind and charitable donations.
    </p>
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-semibold text-ink md:text-3xl">
      Ways to Donate:
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <span class="pill">Bank transfer</span> If you would like to make a bank transfer,
      it is possible to wire your donation directly to our bank account in India.
      (We recommend that you check with your bank as to what charges may be made
      for the transfer):
    </p>
    <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-muted/80 p-4 ring-1 ring-border/20">
      <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink md:text-2xl">Bank Details:</h4>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">
        Name: Jonang Takten Phuntsok Chosling Cultural Society
      </p>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">Bank name: State Bank of India</p>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">Account No: 4008 4616 933</p>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">SWIFT code: SBININBB104</p>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">IFSC code: SBIN 0000 691</p>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">Branch code: 00691</p>
    </div>
    <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
      If you wish, please specify how you would like your donation to be used.
      We would like to ensure that we use every donation for the use it is
      intended. Also, when making a donation via bank transfer, it is
      recommended to alert the monastery via e-mail so that we may confirm the
      receipt of your donation.
    </p>
    <SectionDivider class="section-divider--muted" />
    <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink md:text-2xl">
      Contact Information:
    </h4>
    <ul class="mb-6 text-muted">
      <li>Phone: +91 117 2841410 (office)</li>
      <li>Phone: +91 177 2645280 (mobile)</li>
      <li>
        Email: <a
          href="mailto:office@jonangmonastery.com"
          class="text-accent underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent-soft hover:underline"
          >office@jonangmonastery.com</a
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <span class="pill">Send a cheque</span> If you wish to post a donation to the monastery,
      please make cheques payable to:
    </p>
    <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-muted/80 p-4 ring-1 ring-border/20">
      <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink md:text-2xl">Cheque Details:</h4>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">
        Name: Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling Cultural Society
      </p>
      <p class="mb-1 text-muted">
        Postal address: Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling Tibetan Buddhist
        Monastery, Sanjauli, Shimla, Himachal Pradesh, 171006, India
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }
</style>
